  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# PCA UE \u00b7 EDR ingestion on Docker Swarm\n\n**Path covered:** Fedex \u2192 Kafka `pcaue.<tenant UUID>.<schema>.json` \u2192 PVStorage `--pcaueni` \u2192 ClickHouse. The separate session-metrics path through Ignite/Spark/Druid is not measured here and is absent in Analytics Lite.\n\n**Read telemetry health first.** UP means the metrics endpoint was scraped, not that ingestion or the customer API is ready. DOWN means a scrape failed; No targets means the expected scrape jobs are missing/disabled. Inserter and Kafka panels omit samples from DOWN targets rather than displaying an old value as healthy.\n\n**Idle versus missing data:** PVStorage creates labelled counters lazily. An idle tenant can have no row counters until its first insert; error counters can be absent until the first failed insert/malformed row. \u2018No counter yet\u2019 is not a failure and is not proof of zero errors. A real zero rate means an existing counter did not increase while telemetry remained available.\n\n**Filters:** tenant and schema are discovered from PCA UE Kafka topics. They filter row/dataset counters and Kafka panels; health and ClickHouse pressure always cover the deployment. Consumer group defaults to All groups with offsets for those topics (the standard inserter uses `pv_storage.db`). Lag is Kafka messages, not EDR rows; an uncommitted offset of -1 is unknown, not zero lag. Message/row rates need not match.\n\nThe counters measure inserted EDR rows, not distinct subscribers or network bytes. They do not prove end-to-end freshness or collector connectivity. Use the linked Roadrunner/Fedex and ClickHouse dashboards for deeper diagnosis."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "PCA UE inserter scrapes",
      "description": "Worst current scrape state across this component's configured targets. No result means no matching jobs, not healthy. Independent of tenant/schema filters; up measures scrape availability only.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "No targets",
          "decimals": 0
